---
// Static terminal-output panel for the landing page "See it work" section.
// Lives as an Astro component because MDX cannot reliably parse a multi-line
// <pre> with embedded coloring spans.
---

<div class="dl-term">
  <div class="dl-term-bar">$ deal check --verify --run-sims</div>
  <pre><span class="t-mut">deal 0.1 · checking project 'ev-platform'</span>
<span class="t-cy">▸ parse</span>        37 files            <span class="t-ok">ok</span>
<span class="t-cy">▸ resolve</span>      218 symbols          <span class="t-ok">ok</span>
<span class="t-cy">▸ units</span>        dimensional algebra <span class="t-ok">ok</span>
<span class="t-cy">▸ simulate</span>     2 stale bindings
  <span class="t-pr">python</span>  thermal/motor_thermal.py    <span class="t-ok">✓ 0.8s</span>
  <span class="t-pr">matlab</span>  dynamics/motor_efficiency.m <span class="t-ok">✓ 3.1s</span>

<span class="t-cy">▸ verify</span>       evaluating 14 criteria
  <span class="t-ok">PASS</span>  REQ_MOT_001  peakPower 142 kW <span class="t-mut">&gt;= 140 kW</span>
